#: packages/woocommerce-admin/src/Notes/OnlineClothingStore.php:82
msgid "Starting a fashion website is exciting but it may seem overwhelming as well. In this article, we'll walk you through the setup process, teach you to create successful product listings, and show you how to market to your ideal audience."
msgstr "Iniciar unha web de moda é emocionante, pero tamén pode parecer abrumador. Neste artigo, guiarémoste a través do proceso de configuración, ensinarémosche a crear listas de produtos exitosas e mostrarémosche como comercializar á túa audiencia ideal."

#: packages/woocommerce-admin/src/Notes/StartDropshippingBusiness.php:68
